  "title": "Q063 문제 풀이 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "An IAM role policy allows an API action in a member account, but an organization SCP blocks that action. What is the result?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>문제 풀이</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 063</p><h1>문제 풀이</h1></div><strong>63 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"63번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:58%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q063\" data-question=\"Q063\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q063</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An IAM role policy allows an API action in a member account, but an organization SCP blocks that action. What is the result?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The IAM Allow takes precedence</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The action is denied by the SCP restriction</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 최대 권한 경계다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>의 Allow만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>의 제한을 넘을 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">이전 문제 <b>Q062</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q064/\">다음 문제 <b>Q064</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
